* S05 selection fixture; not wireless qualification
VMOD mod 0 PULSE(-1 1 0 50n 50n 2.495e-05 50u)
BSIG src 0 V=0.01*(1+0.5*v(mod))*sin(2*pi*31meg*time)+0.01*sin(2*pi*29000000*time+0)+0.01*sin(2*pi*33000000*time+0)
