RC2 vcc c2 1000
REU2 e2 eb2 33
REB2 eb2 0 220
CEB2 eb2 0 330p
CBUF c2 bb 100p
RBTB vcc bb 10k
RBBB bb 0 10k
QBUF vcc bb ee 2N3904
REBUF ee 0 470
COBUF ee rf 1n
RRF rf 0 1000
* Actual Nexperia BAT85 manufacturer model; not BAT85S
RCONNECT rf an 0.1
XDET an det BAT85
RDET det 0 4700
CDET det 0 100p
RFILT det out 4700
CFILT out 0 100p
RLOAD out 0 1000000000000000.0
.SUBCKT BAT85 1 2
D1 1 2 BAT85
R1 1 2 5.416E+7
.MODEL BAT85 D
+ IS = 2.076E-7
+ N = 1.023
+ BV = 33
+ IBV = 10E-6
+ RS = 2.326
+ CJO = 1.21E-11
