RVB ref 0 10k
CVREF ref 0 10u
CCOUP out bbin 100n
RBIAS bbin ref 100k
RG neg ref 10k
RFB bbo neg 210000
XOPA bbin neg vcc 0 bbo OPAx197
ROUT bbo final 100
RBBLOAD final 0 1000000.0
CLOAD final 0 100p
